# AFCI-Bench study v2 — reproducibility hygiene.
#
# The v2 pipeline hashes byte-exact payloads (e.g. the canonical architecture
# context delivered identically to the repository-instruction conditions) and
# parses committed TypeScript fixtures with the compiler API. Pinning LF in the
# working tree makes those hashes and parses reproducible across platforms,
# overriding any local core.autocrlf setting. Existing blobs are already LF, so
# this introduces no content change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
